  "description": "AnySat is a multimodal Earth Observation foundation model based on a joint embedding predictive architecture (JEPA) and scale-adaptive spatial encoders, enabling training on highly heterogeneous data (resolutions, scales, modalities) in a self-supervised manner. It is pretrained on GeoPlex, a collection of 5 multimodal datasets with 11 sensors, and achieves state-of-the-art results on a wide range of downstream tasks and external datasets.",
